  title: 'National Day - 1966 '
  info: 'While not tied to a specific culture, National Day celebrates Singapore''s
    independence and unity as a nation. First held in 1966, it became a holiday that
    brings together all communities in Singapore to honor their shared history and
    progress with parades, performances, and fireworks.  '
